#: app/Library/Welcome.php:64
msgid "Extendify Banner"
msgstr "Extendify Banner"

#: app/Library/Welcome.php:69
msgid "Welcome to Extendify"
msgstr "Velkommen til Extendify"

#: app/Library/Welcome.php:72
msgid "Extendify is a massive library of drop-in black patterns easily customized to your liking. Each pattern is meticulously designed to work with your existing WordPress theme."
msgstr "Extendify er et stort bibliotek af træk og slip-blokgrupper, som nemt kan tilpasses efter dine ønsker. Hvert blokgruppe er designet til at fungere med dit eksisterende WordPress-tema."

#: app/Library/Welcome.php:82
msgid "When editing a page or post within the block editor, you'll see the Extendify library button within the editor's header"
msgstr "Når du redigerer en side eller et indlæg i blokeditoren, vil du se Extendify Bibliotek-knappen i editorens sidehoved"

#. translators: %1$s = URL.
#: app/Library/Welcome.php:87
msgid "You may also add a new page with the library opened for you by %1$s."
msgstr "Du kan også tilføje en ny side med biblioteket åbnet ved at %1$s."

#. translators: %1$s = URL.
#: app/Library/Welcome.php:87
msgid "clicking here"
msgstr "klikke her"

#: app/Library/Welcome.php:100
msgid "2. Choose a site industry"
msgstr "2. Vælg en branche for et webstedet"

#: app/Library/Welcome.php:103
msgid "With the library open, you can set your site industry - or type - which will surface the perfect industry-specific patterns and full page layouts to drop onto your website."
msgstr "Når biblioteket er åbent, kan du indstille din branche - eller type - for at få vist de perfekte branchespecifikke blokgrupper og layouts, som du kan tilføje på dit websted."

#: app/Library/Welcome.php:106
msgid "Extendify supports over sixty types with new industries added regularly."
msgstr "Extendify understøtter over tres typer, og nye brancher tilføjes regelmæssigt."

#: app/Library/Welcome.php:113
msgid "3. Browse Patterns & Layouts."
msgstr "3. Gennemse blokgrupper og layouts."

#: app/Library/Welcome.php:116
msgid "Search by industry, contents, and design attributes. Extendify has thousands of best-in-class block patterns. Find what you love and add it to the page - done!"
msgstr "Søg efter branche, indhold og designattributter. Extendify har tusindvis af de bedste blokgrupper. Find det, du elsker, og tilføj det til siden - færdig!"

#: app/Library/Welcome.php:119
msgid "You'll find beautiful high fidelity Gutenberg content to add to your pages in no time!"
msgstr "Du kommer hurtigt til at finde smukt Gutenberg-indhold i høj kvalitet, som du kan tilføje til dine sider!"

#: app/Library/Welcome.php:129
msgid "Upgrade to Extendify Pro"
msgstr "Opgrader til Extendify Pro"

#: app/Library/Welcome.php:132
msgid "Do you want more patterns and layouts - without limits? Choose one of our plans and receive unlimited access to our complete library."
msgstr "Vil du have flere blokgrupper og layouts - uden begrænsninger? Vælg et af vores abonnementer og få ubegrænset adgang til vores komplette bibliotek."

#: app/Library/Welcome.php:136
msgid "View Pricing"
msgstr "Se priser"

#: app/Library/Welcome.php:79
msgid "1. Open the Extendify Library"
msgstr "1. Åbn Extendify Library"

#: app/Library/Plugin.php:58
msgid "You are not allowed to install plugins on this site."
msgstr "Du har ikke tilladelse til at installere plugins på dette websted."

#: app/Library/Plugin.php:74
msgid "There was an error installing your plugin"
msgstr "Der opstod en fejl under installationen af dit plugin"

#: app/Library/Plugin.php:80
msgid "An unknown error occurred during installation"
msgstr "En ukendt fejl opstod under installationen"

#: app/Library/Admin.php:51
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Opgrader"

#: app/Library/Controllers/PluginController.php:53 app/Library/Plugin.php:36
msgid "You are not allowed to activate plugins on this site."
msgstr "Du har ikke tilladelse til at aktivere plugins på dette websted."

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://extendify.com/?utm_source=wp-plugins&utm_campaign=plugin-uri&utm_medium=wp-dash"
msgstr "https://extendify.com/?utm_source=wp-plugins&utm_campaign=plugin-uri&utm_medium=wp-dash"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "Extendify is the platform of site design and creation tools for people that want to build a beautiful WordPress website with a library of patterns and full page layouts for the Gutenberg block editor."
msgstr "Extendify er platformen for hjemmesidedesign- og oprettelsesværktøjer til dem, der ønsker at skabe et smukt WordPress-websted med et bibliotek af blokgrupper og layouts til Gutenberg-blokeditoren."

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://extendify.com/?utm_source=wp-plugins&utm_campaign=author-uri&utm_medium=wp-dash"
msgstr "https://extendify.com/?utm_source=wp-plugins&utm_campaign=author-uri&utm_medium=wp-dash"

